# Domain allowlist for one-click "Install Chatbot Automatically" —
# consumed by kvl-installer-daemon.py, re-read on every request (no
# restart needed after editing).
#
# Deploy this file to /etc/kvl/auto-install-domains.txt on the VPS host
# (NOT inside the repo checkout — this is host config, not app code).
#
# One domain per line, no scheme/path/port — exactly the hostname a
# tenant's "Connected website" URL resolves to. Add a domain here only
# once you've personally verified it's hosted on THIS VPS behind this
# host's own nginx (an /etc/nginx/sites-available/<domain> or conf.d/
# file must already exist for it — add-widget.sh looks it up by exact
# domain match). Lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# Example:
# crm.kvlbusinesssolutions.com
